OL,3,AANC under pressure to reverse South
OL,4,AAfrica decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the ANC, the elections are a chance
OL,7,Fto prove it still has what it takes to
OL,8,Fgovern. The party had a disastrous
OL,9,Fshowing in the last national election,
OL,10,Fwhen it lost its parliamentary majority
OL,11,Ffor the first time since 1994 when the
OL,12,Fracist apartheid system ended.
